      "title": "Letterboxd review of The Matrix Reloaded",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"The Matrix Reloaded\"] The most telling scene on rewatch is that electronic rave montage; a sea of white, brown, and black bodies moving, sweating, grabbing each other, expressing a sense of kinetic freedom... Wachowski sisters, better than most, understand that a vital element of compelling action (that freeway set piece is still undoubtedly an all-timer) is truly understanding what our heroes are fighting for.Full discussion on episode 68 of my podcast SLEAZOIDS.",
